    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "No, not directly—I rely more on textbooks and tutors. However, if I had access to an AI assistant, I’d likely use it for quick explanations or step-by-step guidance when stuck. My high conscientiousness might push me to research solutions independently first before turning to tools.",
